msgid "Audio (mp3, m4a, ogg, wav) or short video (mp4, webm), up to 25 MB. Long interviews go on YouTube. The file goes to the site as it is: phone videos may carry hidden data (GPS, phone model), so prefer audio or a video already cleaned."
